Working case of a periodic pipe 
Version: OpenFOAM 10 
Solver: denseParticleFoamfvModels
 Original denseParticleFoam solver was not updating the momentum source defined in fvModels. A source term in the Ueqn was added similarly to what is done in pimpleFOAM and now the update is working. The new solver is called denseParticleFoamfvModels
